le.\n- The rest of the file, including the \"The Radar fits its window\" section and the line 339/344 media-query overflow rules, was not seen.\n\nNo files modified so far. The ticket's specific overflow bug has not yet been pinpointed. The candidates are the radar.css window-fit and responsive rules, and the landing.css branded scrolling."
